WEBVTT

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.440
The Gutsy Geoid Guard, also known as GGG.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.530
This is the headquarters for the cornerstone of the world's defense...

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:15.280
...the GGG Bay Tower Base Station.

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:19.120
Everything from the research on enemy Zonders...

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.700
...the maintenance and development of the Brave Robots...

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.170
...used both in battle and for rescue operations...

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.000
...to every detail regarding the GGG members' daily lives...

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.920
...every last function of this base station is administered...

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.680
...and executed by this computer system...

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.890
...developed by this man...

00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:42.890
...scruffy and unhygienic, but boasting an IQ of 300...

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.770
...none other than Kohsuke Entohji.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:51.610
But a malevolent force is about to infiltrate this system built by Entohji...

00:00:54.570 --> 00:01:00.330
2 Years Ago

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.870
Chief, Kohtaroh Taiga.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.450
Head of Operations, Geki Hyuuma.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:05.160
Executive Supervisor, Dr. Leo Shishioh.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.790
Head of Computer System Development...

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.050
Kohsuke Entohji.

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:18.970
You just can't let go what happened 2 years ago, can you?

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:22.720
Aren't you filled with hate? Aren't you full of bitterness?

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:26.890
Go forth and show them all just how powerful you are!

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:41.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:44.090
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:51.170
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:55.090
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:57.210 --> 00:02:01.810
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:06.090
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:11.010
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:14.930
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.730
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.490
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:26.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:29.660
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:32.200
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.330
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:35.330 --> 00:02:38.290
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:42.370
Dividing Driver!

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:50.010
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:55.890
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:55.890 --> 00:02:58.840
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:02.730
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:05.160
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:08.160
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:10.160
GGG in the Cross-hairs

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.290
<i>GGG in the Cross-hairs</i>

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:24.640
All right, we're good!

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:27.720
Mr. Hyuuma, I'm so sorry that I'm making you help out like this.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.100
Hey, don't forget you're taking me out to dinner!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.560
StealthGao, maintenance complete.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.150
How does it look, Lieutenant Ushiyama?

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:36.440
Looks like you're all set.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:38.400
Hey, you must be hungry by now.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.570
I know you've been waiting all this time to refuel!

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.030
Roger!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.170
Brain waves, normal.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.290
Machine Heart, functioning normally.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.170
Checkup now complete!

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.340
Okay, then what do you say we go hang out somewhere?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:03:59.630
No way!

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.260
We're on Level 3 Alert, remember?

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:03.130
Oh, that's right.

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.220
Really, now!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.720
Bonjour, one and all!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:10.390
Chief? Is something the matter?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.270
Oh, no. It's just that things are a bit boring upstairs...

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:15.310
...so I came down to see what's going on.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.360
And what may I ask is this?

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:21.030
It's a series on satellite TV. We've got some downtime, so...

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.700
People need to take breaks, you know!

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.370
Come on, why don't you join in on the fun?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.160
Oh, good morning.

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:32.910
Entohji, don't tell me you were here all night again?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:33.710
Uh-huh.

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.880
Maybe you should go home for a while.

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:39.840
Oh, but the thing is, I can sleep a lot better here.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.100
What's going on?

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.100
Emergency Code 08!

00:04:50.180 --> 00:04:53.180
Sensors detect an unidentified element and it's infiltrated the base!

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.020
What?

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.350
How did it get in? How many intruders are there?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:57.560
I can't say at this time!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.110
Look at that, even the computers are thrown off!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.990
Entohji, what's going on with the security system?

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:04.650
I'm looking into it right now.

00:05:05.660 --> 00:05:08.950
Areas 5, 6, and 7 have all been penetrated!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.580
The Target is still on the move...

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.790
Oh! I've lost sight of the Target!

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.920
This isn't good! The Operating System is right there!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:21.300
I don't believe this! It compromised the security system I built myself?

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.220
Gai!

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.300
I can't stop the system!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.560
Gai!

00:05:36.940 --> 00:05:37.940
Mikoto?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:39.810
Mikoto!

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:42.980
HyoRyu!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.240
What are you doing? Hurry up and switch systems!

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.450
That's what we're doing!

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:48.160
There's no reason for this not to be working!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.320
Can't you shut down the main power switch?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.200
We have! It switched to backup power!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.500
What the heck's going on?

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:06.220
Um, thank you very much.

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:10.260
Now you know why I'm always after you to get into shape?

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:13.260
Hey there, Main Order Room! Is anybody there?

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.060
Oh, heck! We can't even get through anymore?

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:38.710
The system is...

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.370
It's been overwritten!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:41.750
Ridiculous...

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:45.340
Has this base been taken over?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:49.050
There's only one person capable of such a thing...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.130
It can't be!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:55.970
Just as I thought, Inubouzaki!

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.140
Has he been Zonderized?

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:14.080
Don't tell me...

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.660
We have no way of resisting under these conditions!

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.950
Dammit!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:21.040
Major! Our hands are completely tied!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:23.210
Idiot! Fix it somehow!

00:07:25.590 --> 00:07:27.340
Even the emergency controls are shot!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.260
He's sealed off all the hallways! There's no way for us to escape!

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.140
Inubouzaki!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.270
Don't you remember that we were once comrades?

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:41.190
I'm asking you to at least let the other team members go!

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:42.730
Inubouzaki!

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:49.820
It's futile, Chief.

00:07:50.030 --> 00:07:53.070
Unfortunately, if the Zonder infection has progressed this far...

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.160
...I don't believe he has a shred of humanity left inside him.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.700
Right...

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:03.250
As of now, this entity shall be referred to as EI-15!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.520
This is an exclusive emergency route for the Intelligence Unit.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:23.980
We can reach the Base Station using an auxiliary system.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:27.150
I've got Inubouzaki's present location.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:30.820
He seems to be near the center of the GGG Bay Tower, in the B Line.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:38.660
Zonder!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.040
Has he taken over the Big Order Room?

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.330
What could he possibly be up to next?

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.760
No! The power reactor!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.880
He appears to have shut down the cooling systems!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.840
If this keeps up, the power reactor will overheat!

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.390
No! We can't have this! The entire base will explode!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:02.850
Inubouzaki!

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.520
System Change!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:14.740
Volfogg!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.240
Volfogg, I'm coming with you!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.280
No, you mustn't. I cannot allow it.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:22.910
If the power reactor continues to overheat like this...

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.540
It will prove disastrous for G-Island City as well.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.920
Therefore, Special Agent Mamoru, seek shelter as far away as possible.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.880
But I can't just desert everyone like that...

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.970
From here on in, I want you to leave it to me.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.390
No way! I don't want to just run off by myself!

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.890
Special Agent Mamoru!

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:47.900
And besides! How are you going to Purify the Zonders if I'm not there?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.480
That is not something that my A.I. I can determine.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.570
Without a direct command from the Main Order Room...

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.110
Then Volfogg, I'm commanding you as a member of GGG!

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.450
Save everybody and destroy that Zonder!

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.250
Understood, sir.

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:14.800
Then let us put this operation into action.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:15.630
Okay!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.780
I can't get through to Gai.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.990
We can assume EnRyu and HyoRyu will be immobilized for a while.

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:45.200
Do we have any other options?

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.410
Chief...

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:48.540
You're forgetting something, sir.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.210
A crucial part of our team...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:53.840
That sound...

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:56.510
What on Earth?

00:10:58.300 --> 00:11:00.380
What can it be?

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.720
Oh, it couldn't be...

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.270
Oh! Volfogg!

00:11:09.480 --> 00:11:11.270
Volfogg...

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:15.820
System Operator, Kohsuke Entohji!

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.250
We're counting on you, Volfogg!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.810
The Multidimensional Intelligence Ship's functions are...

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.560
...all independent of the Base Station.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:56.940
It is safe to assume that they have not been affected by the Zonder takeover.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:58.150
Then that means...

00:11:58.280 --> 00:11:58.860
Yes.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.530
We shall strike at the Zonder with the Multidimensional computer system.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:07.530
It's no good, I can't shut down the power reactor!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.620
We can't avoid a massive explosion if this keeps up!

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.290
Oh, my God!

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:26.600
Now, Special Agent Mamoru, please advise me of the Zonder's location.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:27.550
Okay.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.600
Volfogg!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.230
So it's actually able to move inside the computer!

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:46.280
We're about to hit critical mass...

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:49.410
I guess this is it for us, then...

00:12:50.490 --> 00:12:53.410
Article 5, Section 125 of the GGG Charter!

00:12:54.830 --> 00:13:00.250
"Under no circumstances may a GGG member ever give up!"

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.680
That's right! We shall never give up! No matter what the circumstances!

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.090
Zonder!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:14.890
Hey, Inubouzaki, if you've...

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.480
...transferred yourself over to the Multidimensional Intelligence Ship...

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:21.690
...well, that's where I've set my trap!

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:22.900
What the?

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.250
Ah, he fell for it.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:36.790
That is the anti-hacker Destruction Program written by Operator Entohji!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.550
Waha! The Base is back to normal now!

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.010
Yes. But we have not obliterated the enemy just yet.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:49.970
The real battle is just about to begin!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:55.430
Startup connectors, 79% severed...

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.060
This is so messed up...

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.400
The main high-pressure injection pump is now operating...

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:02.860
ECCS activated!

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:05.360
No threat of explosion.

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.070
We have regained control of the Operating System.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.030
The current location of the Zonder is...

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:13.120
Above the C Line, inside the hangar for replacement parts!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.830
Here's the video...

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.370
Give me power...

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:19.380
...give me power...

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.380
Apparently, the Zonder has escaped below us.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.340
Special Agent Mamoru, please take refuge up in the Main Order Room.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.510
Well, you'd better not overdo it!

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.140
Promise me, okay, Volfogg?

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:34.890
Very well. I promise you.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.640
Are those robot parts?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.480
He's assimilating them all...

00:14:44.690 --> 00:14:46.320
He's turned into a Zonder Robo!

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:49.490
Zonder!

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:18.560
Operator Entohji! Open the hatch!

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:19.890
Gotcha!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.440
Now opening the Exterior Hatch!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:32.490
Hey, wait up, Yosef!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.870
Let's take a break now!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.960
Zonder!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.380
Three Become One!

00:15:56.680 --> 00:16:00.770
Big Volfogg!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.690
4,000 Magnum!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.360
Melting Siren!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.490
His barrier is broken!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:17.030
Murasame Sword!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:22.080
Big Volfogg!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.630
HyoRyu and EnRyu, recovery rate 40%!

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:26.750
They won't be ready to go into battle for another hour!

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.840
Since the startup program for the GaoMachines has been deleted...

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.300
...we are unable to launch!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.640
Hmm, so we can't send GaoGaiGar into battle, eh?

00:16:43.980 --> 00:16:45.230
There is another way!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.730
We haven't even begun to fight yet!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:04.960
Come on, we're going to finish this now!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.880
Everybody! Are you ready for this?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.210
I'll take care of StealthGao!

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.800
LinerGao's good to go, too!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.720
I've got DrillGao...

00:17:16.090 --> 00:17:19.260
Kazuo Ushiyama, all set to launch! Just say the word and we'll fuse!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:24.810
The success rate for a manual Final Fusion is only 31.2%...

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.060
It's too dangerous!

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.230
What did you say?

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:32.230
This is no time to hesitate!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:35.240
He's right. We've got to act now, or we'll just be destroyed!

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.950
GGG members aren't ever supposed to give up, isn't that right?

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:46.040
Chief, if we support the fusion from here, the success rate will go to 60%.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.250
If we each compensate with 10% courage, we can reach 100%!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.960
Chief! I, too, request your approval!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.130
As long as we at least have a chance...

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.590
Right! There's no reason to hesitate!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:00.550
Chief!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:03.970
All right, then.

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:06.600
Final Fusion, Manual Docking, approved!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.850
Roger!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.520
Final Fusion Manual Docking...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.110
Program Drive!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:16.900
Support Program... start!

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:23.080
Final Fusion!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.210
Now inserting DrillGao. Starting support!

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.840
Next up, StealthGao and LinerGao! Let's go!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.680
Fusion, start!

00:18:45.310 --> 00:18:47.430
Don't lose it! We're going to try it again!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.060
What the...

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.230
I won't let you get in the way!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:28.680
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:30.190
They did it!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.150
Zonder!

00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:45.910
Let's go!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.910
Broken Magnum!

00:19:53.080 --> 00:19:55.630
The enemy has gotten ahold of GGG data and mecha parts!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:59.050
I wouldn't be surprised if he had the same powers as GaoGaiGar!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.770
No way can you beat the real deal!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.530
To think that he has equal powers!

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:28.830
If that's the case...

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.330
Hell and Heaven!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.750
Gemu, giru, gan, go, gufo!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.600
Why? What in the world just happened?

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:02.070
Don't tell me...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:05.660
Zonder!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:14.160
Inubouzaki, you were always one to forget the most crucial thing...

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:18.000
The difference between a copy and the real thing...

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.340
In other words...

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.590
What a hero is made of!

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.030
Curatio...

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:54.540
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:58.630
...salus, coctura!

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:14.310
Good job, Special Agent Mamoru.

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:25.860
Gai?

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.400
Big Brother Gai?

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.660
GGG has just overcome its most dire crisis.

00:22:32.780 --> 00:22:36.870
But GaoGaiGar is now undergoing a crucial change...

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.170
...and it is sure to affect the tide of war...

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:48.650
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:54.120
Piercing the tranquility of midday, large projectiles rain down on the city.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.830
ChoRyuJin takes a direct hit and is blasted into the skies!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:24:01.160
And now that he is unable to use his ultimate move, Hell and Heaven...

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.500
...what are GaoGaiGar's chances for victory?

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:05.630
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.300
"Midday Demon"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
Midday Demon

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.470
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.430
Dividing Driver
Transporter

00:24:12.510 --> 00:24:14.840
This is the Key to Victory!
